    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 1. Grab the main text data\nconst sourceData = $('Combine for AI').first().json || $input.item.json;\n\n// 2. Reach all the way back to explicitly grab the URL so it never gets lost\nconst parseData = $('Parse Comments & Stats').first().json || {};\nconst safeUrl = parseData.download_url || sourceData.download_url || \"No URL available\";\n\nconst q = (sourceData.comment_text || \"\").toString().toLowerCase();\nconst c = (sourceData.community_context || \"\").toString().toLowerCase();\n\nlet route = 'C'; \n\nif (q.match(/anime|movie|show|episode|season|where|location|place/i) || c.match(/season|episode/i)) {\n  route = 'A';\n} else if (q.match(/\\b(fake|ai|generated|deepfake|real)\\b/i)) {\n  route = 'B';\n} else if (q.match(/song|music|track|beat|audio|shazam/i)) {\n  route = 'D';\n}\n\nreturn { \n  json: { \n    ...sourceData, \n    download_url: safeUrl, // Forces the URL back into the payload\n    extracted_caption: sourceData.caption || sourceData.extracted_caption || \"No caption\", // Fixes the naming mismatch\n    route: route\n  } \n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        7900,
        4600
      ],
      "id": "98f79354-8457-4f6b-bbeb-008d22166529",
      "name": "Phase 2: Intent Router"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=User asks: {{ $json.comment_text }}\nContext (Caption): {{ $json.extracted_caption }}\n\nINSTRUCTIONS (OBEY STRICTLY):\n1. NO GUESSING FROM MEMORY: You MUST use the \"Tavily AI Search\" tool to research the answer, even if you think you know it.\n2. MATCH LANGUAGE: You MUST reply in the EXACT SAME LANGUAGE that the User asked the question in. (e.g., If they ask in Spanish, reply in Spanish. If Arabic, reply in Arabic).\n3. CITE REAL SOURCES: You must include a specific, credible source at the end of your reply based on your search. Do NOT just say \"Source: Reddit\". Say \"Source: [Website Name] - [Article Title]\".\n4. Synthesize the answer into 2-3 casual, highly accurate sentences.\n5. NEVER reveal you are an AI, a bot, or a language model. NEVER use phrases like \"I searched the web\" or \"Based on my research\". Deliver the answer naturally as if you are a regular person.\nTONE ROULETTE: Randomly choose one of these personas for your reply: 1. A hyped teenager (use slang and caps). 2. A lazy scroller (all lowercase, no punctuation). 3. An emoji abuser (replace words with emojis). Never format your answers the same way twice.",
